      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Agree that it is about time they officially support it by binding the joysticks correctly.\n\nAlso letting you know that there are working bindings. For example look for the one I use and published: STEAMVR 1.6.10 WMR VRC BINDINGS 2.0. \nLet me know if that solves your issue with the movement.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
