      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Extra note on this issue, people may be experiencing different behaviour from the custom bindings depending on if they use the vrchat setting for Vive Advanced Controls. If you have that setting toggled off I would bet you would have issues using the joysticks with the custom bindings or it would not feel correct. For example I have only ever tested my published bindings with the advanced settings toggled on because that is all I use in vrchat which may be why I do not see any of the issues people are reporting. So I think the top custom bindings including mine do work for both settings but might only have been tested for one.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
